    ],
    "text": "[S101][[A102]OB[/A102]][/S101] [IMG103] If\n[I104]size[/I104] is 0,\n\n[IMG105] [S106][[A107]OB CX[/A107]][/S106]\n[IMG108] or either [I109]nelem[/I109] or [I110]elsize[/I110] is 0,\n\n[IMG111] [S112][[A113]OB[/A113]][/S112] [IMG114] either: [IMG115]",
    "placeholders": {
